  m_text: "The discovery of hundreds of copper coins, once believed to have been
    used in everyday transactions, offers a glimpse into ancient Temasek\u2019s bustling
    commerce. Coins change hands, goods are exchanged, and people from different
    places meet and connect. These scenes capture the energy of trade and the human
    relationships that grow from it. "
